<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia April trade deficit narrows to $126.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia April trade deficit narrows to $126.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				   April	   March	   April 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -126.4	  -154.8	    -106.6</p>
<p>    Exports		    749.4	   669.8	     723.4</p>
<p>    Imports		    875,8	   824.7	     830.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Differences due to rounding. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
